  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 960603,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1st Spritedemo: A Commodore 64 Football Management Challenge\n\nStep into the boots of a manager in *1st Spritedemo*, a thrilling football management simulation for the Commodore 64! This demo offers a taste of what could be a full-fledged game, placing you in charge of a team competing in one of England's top four leagues. \n\nExperience the pressure of matchday as you select your starting lineup and tactical approach. Following each game, meticulously review detailed reports covering player injuries, crucial results from rival matches, and the vital financial health of your club.  Careful resource management is key to success!\n\n*1st Spritedemo* showcases impressive sprite-based graphics for the C64, bringing the action to life. While a demo, it provides a solid foundation for strategic team building, player development, and the pursuit of league glory.  Can you guide your team to victory and navigate the challenges of English football?  Download the demo and prove your managerial skills!"
    },
